<title>MEXICO: Mexico to sign new &quot;pacto&quot; Saturday - gov't.</title>
<headline>Mexico to sign new &quot;pacto&quot; Saturday - gov't.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico will sign a new phase of its prices and wage pact called the Alliance for Economic Recovery on Saturday, a spokesman from the President's Office said on Friday.</p>
<p>The alliance, known universally as the &quot;pacto&quot;, will be signed by the government alongside business and labour leaders in the presidential palace Los Pinos, he added. No time was given for the renewal.</p>
<p>--Henry Tricks, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289560.</p>
</text>
